  "title": "Emporia Main Street Receives $100,000 Small Business Accelerator Grant From The Hartford",
  "summary": "EMPORIA, Kan., July 28, 2026 Emporia Main Street has been awarded a $100,000 Small Business Accelerator Grant from The Hartford, in partnership with Main Street America. This grant will help expand its successful makerspace and strengthen the entrepreneurial ecosystem in downtown Emporia. Emporia Main Street's Fabrication Lab, a makerspace that supports entrepreneurs and small manufacturers, will benefit from the grant as the organization expands its innovation hub with additional space,",
